Title: Moonbound (genre test, written for this repo)

EPISODE 1

EXT. FOREST EDGE - NIGHT

A full moon. TARA, a village healer, gathers herbs alone.

A growl from the trees. Tara freezes.

TARA
(whispering)
Whoever you are, I have nothing worth stealing.

A wounded wolf limps out of the dark and collapses at her feet.

Tara kneels. The wolf's blood glows silver on her hands.

TARA
(shocked)
Silver blood. That's not possible.

The wolf's body shudders and changes. Where it lay, a MAN now kneels, gasping.

KABIR
(weak)
You touched my blood. You shouldn't have done that.

TARA
(terrified)
What are you?

KABIR
The alpha of the pack your village burned. And now you're bound to me.

Tara looks at her hands. A silver mark spreads across her wrist.

EPISODE 2

INT. TARA'S HUT - DAWN

Tara scrubs her wrist raw. The mark will not fade.

KABIR
(from the doorway)
It won't wash off. It means the moon chose you.

TARA
(angry)
I didn't choose anything. My father leads the hunters.

KABIR
(cold)
I know. He's the one who shot me.

Footsteps outside. Her father's voice calls her name.

TARA
(panicked)
If he sees you, he'll kill you.

KABIR
If he sees that mark, he'll kill you.

The door handle turns.
